hlop_module.py is copied verbatim from the official HLOP-SNN repository
(https://github.com/pkuxmq/HLOP-SNN, Xiao et al., "Hebbian Learning based Orthogonal Projection for
Continual Learning of Spiking Neural Networks", ICLR 2024), Apache License 2.0. It is used unmodified so that
the HLOP baseline in this benchmark runs the authors' own Hebbian subspace learning and projection.
